          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">You can ignore any changes to the Hit stat of this operative&apos;s xenophase blade. Whenever this operative is fighting or retaliating, you can resolve one of your successes before the normal order. If you do, that success must be used to block.</characteristic>
